{"id":"vod_sn_36225","vodId":"36225","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"阿松第一季","name_cn":"阿松第一季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/139e28d8a03662cd25e3fdbf197ce58b.jpg"},"summary":"从昭和到平成，转眼过去了二十年时光。匆忙奔波的闹市中，松野家的六胞胎不留神便长大了。他们分别是长男小松（樱井孝宏 配音）、空松（中村悠一 配音）、轻松（神谷浩史 配音）、一松（福山润 配音）、十四松（小野大辅 配音）以及椴松（入野自由 配音）。虽然有着极其相似的容貌，不过阿松们性格各异，而今他们已成年人的姿态行走于社会，用独到犀利的眼光见证着光怪陆离世界每一天的变化。他们相互吐槽，机锋不断，思索着人存于世至高无上的终极问题，也揭露着当下社会的症结所在。你乐了，那是因为他们无情批判着现实。你哭了，那是因为你恰好深陷其中……　　本片根据日本漫画名将赤冢不二夫的经典名作改编，是赤冢老师诞辰80周年纪念作品。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-12-03 16:36:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EB2JEb6Gtf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UXncv2PNUu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H6q0dwBvXx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b88dNh1wfm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/42GVLshzw61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Egn6tVDskT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xYhRkuwimg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iFbqJVECyy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hWqFKPsgjD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uchfw6ZC5G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GH76ZQhbYB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/13n5z0PjnT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PHaKmA9Rj91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s7k3EgKTWH1/video/index.m3u